  "previousAbc": "\nT:Invocation and Confident Petition\nC:Tune: WOOD; Darius E. Jones\nR:Psalm 28; S. M.\nM:3/2\nL:1/4\nK:F\nN:Printed page 66\n%%score (T1 T2)(B1 B2)\nV:T1 treble\nV:T2 treble\nV:B1 bass\nV:B2 bass\nV:T1\nA2 | G F D2 F2 | G4 || A2 | c A F2 G2 | A4 || G2 | F G A2 c2 | F A G2 || A2 | G F D2 E2 | F4 |]\nw:1.~O Lord, to Thee I cry; Thou art my rock and trust; O be not si-lent, lest I die And slum-ber in the dust.\nw:2.~O hear me when in prayer Thy fa-vor I en-treat; Hear, while I lift im-plor-ing hands Be-fore Thy mer-cy seat.\nw:3.~O let me have no part With those that hate the right; For as their works, so their re-ward: Je-ho-vah will re-quite.\nw:4.~But bless-ed be the Lord Who heark-ens when I cry; The Lord, my strength, my help, my shield, On Him will I re-ly.\nw:5.~His help makes glad my heart, And songs of praise I sing; Je-ho-vah is His peo-ple's strength, The strong-hold of their king.\nw:6.~Bless Thy in-her-it-ance, Our Sav-iour be, I pray; Sup-ply Thou all Thy peo-ple's need, And be their con-stant stay.\nV:T2\nF2 | E D D2 D2 | E4 || F2 | G F F2 E2 | F4 || E2 | D E F2 F2 | F F E2 || F2 | E D D2 C2 | C4 |]\nV:B1\nC2 | C A, B,2 A,2 | C4 || C2 | G, A, A,2 C2 | C4 || C2 | A, C C2 A,2 | C C C2 || C2 | B, A, B,2 C2 | A,4 |]\nV:B2\nF,2 | C, D, B,,2 D,2 | C,4 || F,2 | E, F, D,2 C,2 | F,4 || C,2 | D, C, F,2 F,2 | A, F, C,2 || F,2 | C, D, B,,2 C,2 | F,4 |]\n",
